@base = http://localhost:7071
@token = local-user

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Unauthenticated settings → 401
GET {{base}}/api/v1/settings

### Get settings (defaults: threshold 0.7, sources off, email disconnected)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Patch match threshold (0.10–0.99) and enqueue match-recalc
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matchThreshold": 0.8
}

### Out-of-range threshold → 400
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "matchThreshold": 1.2
}

### Enable Greenhouse (enqueues source-discovery)
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sources": {
    "greenhouseEnabled": true,
    "leverEnabled": false
  }
}

### Microsoft 365 connect (PKCE authorize URL)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/settings/email/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "redirectUri": "http://localhost:3000/oauth-callback.html"
}

### OAuth callback (exchange code + state from the connect response)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/settings/email/callback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "AUTH_CODE",
  "state": "STATE_FROM_CONNECT",
  "redirectUri": "http://localhost:3000/oauth-callback.html"
}

### Disconnect Microsoft 365 (idempotent)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/settings/email/disconnect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
